{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2020-12-02 16:05:00', 'title': 'STRYKER DECLARES A $0.63 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, DEC. 02, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.63 PER SHARE PAYABLE JANUARY 29, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 31, 2020, REPRESENTING AN INCREASE OF 9.6% VERSUS THE PRIOR YEAR AND PREVIOUS QUARTER.\xa0'}